  ('kleptomaniac', 'cleptomaníaco', 'A person who has an uncontrollable, irrational urge to steal objects, typically not because they need them or want them for their value, but due to a psychological impulse.', 'The kleptomaniac was caught stealing a pack of gum from the store.', 'C1', 'noun', 'health', 47625),
